WEBVTT

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.920
A massive monster outbreak?

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:15.460
Yes. The monsters seem to have blocked the way
past Level 24, puzzling the Adventurers there.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.080
They say they've never seen anything like it.

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:19.130
Hmm.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.250
What of the Guild?

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:24.080
Nothing irregular to report as of yet.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.000
I see.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:51.130
If you search for the things you lack with downcast eyes

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:54.830
You'll never discover incredible places like this

00:00:56.710 --> 00:01:01.080
Let's get rid of these vague standards

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.170
And the courage will spread through you

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:11.710
A world without lies reflects in your eyes

00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:15.920
Throw away the useless bravado and

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:20.540
Let's laugh and cry together

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:24.380
We played the strings at our own speed

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:26.580
And embellished how we wished

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:31.540
When you're around miracles can happen RE-ILLUSION

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:34.210
We shined and lit each other up

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:38.960
On the other side our dreams melded together

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:41.170
We created a synergy and

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:48.920
With our strong and genuine bond we crossed the world

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:03.750
A quest, for me?

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:05.330
Yes.

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:11.710
I would like you to investigate
a strange monster outbreak on Level 24.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.000
Why me?

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:17.670
It is very likely that there is a connection
between this occurrence,

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:20.540
the red-haired woman who attacked Rivira...

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:26.960
...and the crystal orb she sought after.

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:30.040
The danger is serious.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:33.670
Sword Princess, please lend us your strength.

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:38.380
Very well then.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:41.330
But before that, could you deliver a message for me?

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.540
Huh.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:48.380
So Level 24's swarmin' with nasty monsters, eh?

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:52.250
Well? Whaddya want from us this time?

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.080
You mistake the purpose of my visit.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:59.170
I merely came to inform a comrade
of the situation we now face.

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:02.580
Tch! What "comrade"? I never asked you for squat.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:05.210
Don't you think it's strange?

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:09.000
The outbreak affects the Adventurers greatly,
yet the Guild hasn't lifted a finger.

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:12.500
It's as if they're hiding something.

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.290
Well...

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.880
It does seem fishy, but I can't afford
to stick my nose too far into this business.

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:19.500
I understand.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:23.500
But I also wonder if it's safe to ignore at this point.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:26.750
Loki!

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:29.080
We just got a letter from Miss Ais.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.000
Hm?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.750
She said she received an urgent quest
and is heading to Level 24.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.000
What?!

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:37.380
You weren't kiddin'!

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.580
Ugh!

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:41.080
"Please don't worry about me," she says!

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:42.580
As if, ya big dummy!

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.000
Lefiya,

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.420
go get Bete for me.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.000
I-I'll be right back!

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.380
Are you going to chase after the Sword Princess?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.000
Yep. A quest suddenly pops up at a time like this?

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.960
Can't help but assume somethin's up.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.130
Loki.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.790
Would you take my Filvis along with your children?

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:01.960
Huh?

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.170
Lord Dionysus!

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:05.000
Filvis...

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.210
I need to earn Loki's trust,

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:09.790
and trust is earned when actions meet words.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:11.670
Do you understand?

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:14.040
I'm sitting right here...

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:15.670
But I...

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:17.960
Go, Filvis.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.670
Everything will be just fine.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.500
There you have it, Loki.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.710
Uh, I never said she could go...

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:33.630
Loki, I brought Bete!

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.420
What's the big deal of a sudden?

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.250
I need both o' ya to head to Level 24, pronto.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:42.130
Sounds like Ais mighta got herself into some big trouble.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.420
And take her with ya.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:45.920
This gloomy chick?

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:57.080
Um... Thank you for coming along with us today.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:13.000
It seems the Adventurers
are starting to stir up a commotion.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:15.960
Are you sure neglecting them is wise?

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.080
It's no skin off my back.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.500
And what will you do if someone tries to go after her,

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.380
as they did on Level 30?

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:28.710
Crush them, of course.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:34.040
First, go and meet up with
your new companions in Rivira.

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.330
The tavern should be around here somewhere...

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.080
I'll have a Potato Popper, matcha cream flavor.

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.290
I've been waiting for you, Mr. Companion...

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.920
I, too, am your-

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:15.210
What?!

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:16.880
S-Sword Princess?!

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:19.670
Is that you, Lulune?

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:22.000
I don't believe it!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.670
They told me they'd send another fighter
for backup, but I never thought...

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:27.420
A high-profile companion, indeed.

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:30.130
The Sword Princess...

00:06:30.330 --> 00:06:33.500
Having Ais Wallenstein as an ally
gives me some confidence.

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:35.330
Are you all...?

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.790
They're members of my Familia.

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.830
This'll be our Party for the quest.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:41.920
Forgive me.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:46.210
My name is Asfi Al Andromeda,
leader of the Hermes Familia.

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:47.790
Perseus...

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:50.790
I shoulda guessed you'd recognize our Asfi.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:52.540
She IS a celebrity, after all.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.330
Thank you for watching over Lulune the other day.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:56.250
Of course.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:58.080
Now that you're here,

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.580
allow me to explain the details

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.130
of the quest we've been assigned.

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:08.960
Fels. Why did you send
the Sword Princess on the quest?

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:12.540
As I've told you before,

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.290
we do not want to make
the Loki Familia our enemies.

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:20.880
She is well-suited to settle the situation at hand.

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:22.540
This will have serious consequences.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:23.920
What?

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:26.040
This already concerns them as well.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:28.420
They will not stand by idly.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:33.500
The quest was assigned to us
by a figure clad in all black.

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:39.500
We've been asked to investigate the origin
of a strange monster outbreak on Level 24.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:45.250
Our only lead is that a similar incident
has occurred on Level 30.

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.210
Level 30...

00:07:47.670 --> 00:07:52.080
The same floor that Hashana Dorlia,
the victim of the recent murder,

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:55.460
picked up that crystal orb.

00:07:56.460 --> 00:08:02.830
I fear this incident may somehow be related
to the one you and Lulune were involved in.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:09.290
It still astounds me that she even accepted
another strange quest after what happened before.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.210
C'mon, I said I was sorry...

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:14.460
This was Lulune's doing?

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:15.880
Yes.

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:17.960
We had no intention of accepting
the quest originally, but...

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:22.420
Yeah! That black-robed jerk
tried to blackmail us, you know!

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.210
Threatening to expose all of our Familia's secrets!

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:26.040
Lulune!

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.460
Hold your tongue.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:30.670
That mouth of yours is what gets us into these messes!

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:33.130
I swear, I'm sorry!

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:36.880
We've gathered all of the necessary equipment.

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:42.580
According to my information, the monster swarm
is somewhere in the vicinity of the Pantry.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.920
We'll check there first.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:49.170
The Pantry is where the monsters store their food, right?

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:52.920
That doesn't seem like a place
where monsters would be swarming...

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:55.920
That's why we're going to investigate.

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:58.210
Shall we be off, then?

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.130
Is everyone ready?

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:03.880
Um, I'm sorry.

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.580
There's just one thing I need to take care of.

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:08.040
You want me to hold onto this?

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:10.250
This piece o' crap?

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.500
It's... important to me.

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:18.460
Really... Well then, in that case
I'll have to take real good care of it, huh?

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:19.710
But ya know,

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:25.630
that kinda care comes with a special price.
I've gotta run my business, after all, right?

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.380
Th-there a problem with that?

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.420
That should cover the cost.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.710
What?!

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.880
If you don't want it,
I'm sure I could find someone else...

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.830
Well, I guess this'll have to do!

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:40.790
I still owe ya for leavin' this sucker with me,
so I'll give ya a real deal just this once!

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:44.460
Thank you.

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:50.710
Well then, let's decide our marching order.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.630
Um, it's okay to walk a little bit closer to us...

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.170
What should we do?

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:07.290
Ignore her.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.380
But...

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:12.210
Um, we're almost to Level 18.

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.790
Why don't we all take a short break?

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:30.380
Sweep them away!

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:32.830
Sacred staff of thunder.

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:34.380
Dio Thyrsos!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.460
Miss Filvis! Thank you for taking care of that!

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:55.670
Filvis is the lone survivor of the Nightmare on Level 27.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.670
The one six years ago?

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:58.580
Yes.

00:10:58.580 --> 00:11:01.080
Even after that, the terrible accidents continued...

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:03.580
She's put a wall up around herself.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:08.580
But, perhaps your children might be able to...

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:13.880
...might be able to liberate her from her past.

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:17.250
Hmph! What WON'T you use my children for?

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:19.330
It's time I get going.

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:30.250
Can I help you? Hermes...

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.080
Well met, Dionysus.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.750
Just now, that was Concurrent Chanting, wasn't it?

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:42.000
If I could do something like that,
I'm sure I could help out my team,

00:11:42.290 --> 00:11:43.920
but I'm not quite there yet...

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:50.210
I'm still in training, but I could really
use some tips if you have any!

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:54.380
I'd be so grateful if you could share a few... with me...

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:03.920
Um, I-I want to learn more about you, Miss Filvis!

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:07.250
Since we've joined up as a Party and all!

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.580
Let me make one thing clear.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.330
We are not a Party.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:15.710
What?

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:21.250
We're just heading to the same destination.
Get that straight in your head.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:30.040
Do you have a moment?

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.500
There's something I'd like to ask you about.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.540
You, the dog who abandoned Zeus for Uranus?

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:40.170
You've got me all wrong.
I'm purely neutral here.

00:12:40.790 --> 00:12:44.290
It just so happens I have something to ask you as well...

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:47.210
What is Uranus hiding?

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:52.460
He isn't hiding anything.
And if he were, I'D want to hear about it as well.

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:58.000
Is that so. Well then, please excuse me.

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.250
Hold on, hold on.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:05.380
My children are making their way to Level 24
right now as well. On a certain quest.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:11.290
I'd like to get a better grasp
on the situation brewing here in Orario myself.

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:17.210
We both came down here from Heaven, didn't we?
What's wrong with a casual chat between gods?

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:18.920
We could get some drinks...

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:23.540
Who knows what I might let slip
once I've had a few glasses.

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:29.630
I do know a place with an impeccable
wine selection. I'll introduce you...

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.830
Strange, isn't it?

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:44.210
We aren't even in the same Familia,
yet I'm working with you for the second time now.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:46.250
Mhmm. By the way...

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:47.330
Yeah?

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.710
Why were you all wearing robes back in town?

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:53.580
Oh. Well, there are SOME things
you just don't share openly, right?

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:56.880
If word got out about our true Ability Levels
or what Dungeon Levels we've reached-

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:57.830
Lulune!

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:03.080
Goodness, do you have a brain at all
in that thick skull of yours?

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:05.210
I-it just slipped...

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:08.540
Sword Princess, pretend
you didn't hear anything just now, okay?

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:13.580
Give me the map. We'll be reaching Level 24 soon.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:14.580
Yes, Boss!

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:19.080
First, we need to locate
the origin of the monster outbreak.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:23.830
We'll have to scour the entire area,
but we can start with the closest Pantry first.

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.460
Anything could happen at this point.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:28.790
Be on your guard, everyone.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:32.710
This is the right Level... isn't it?

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:35.880
I'm sure we'll find them swarming around the Pantries...

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:37.460
We've no choice but to check inside.

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:39.830
Lulune, guide us there.

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:43.920
The closest Pantry is... over there.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:45.380
Wait.

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:48.830
I think it's this way.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:51.580
There does seem to be
another Pantry over there, but...

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:57.420
Very well. Let's head where
the Sword Princess leads us.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:01.250
Can you sense the monsters or something?

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:05.630
Yes... If we continue in this direction,
we should find them.

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:10.380
Wait, Sword Princess!

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:11.710
Quiet.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:12.500
Hm?

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:17.250
Are those all monsters...?

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.830
I see why they made such a fuss about it.

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.170
Everyone, prepare for battle.

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:24.580
Wait.

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:26.580
Let me take care of it.

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.250
Wha-? Sword Princess!

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:40.880
We could probably just leave them all to her...

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:42.500
Wanna go home?

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.630
Now, now, we couldn't just leave her...

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.920
Could she be...?

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:53.000
Why would Miss Filvis say such a thing...?

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.630
Hey, dimwits!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.000
We're goin' to Rivira.

00:15:57.000 --> 00:16:02.130
Maybe we can find a lead that'll point us to
wherever Ais is on Level Twenty fo-

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:05.380
Tch! Hey, where do ya think you're goi-!

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:06.880
Don't touch me!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:18.210
P-please stop, Bete!

00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:24.790
You, you see... it's not customary for Elves
to be in direct contact with other races!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:27.630
I'm sure she meant no offense by it...

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.080
Sword Princess!

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:45.460
Atta girl! I can't believe you took down
that whole swarm single-handedly!

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:50.170
I had heard you were Lv.5.
Did you Rank-Up recently?

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:53.080
I thought so.

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:56.750
After a Rank-Up, you can lose your bearings for a time.

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:59.380
She must have used this fight
to adjust accordingly.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:01.080
You mean that was just practice?!

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.630
The Sword Princess is really somethin' else, huh?

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.500
We've witnessed something great indeed.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.710
Looks like we made it.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.830
Yep! The Pantry's right through there.

00:17:16.330 --> 00:17:18.080
What the heck is that?

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:22.290
The monsters must have faced
the same problem we face now.

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.710
Their way to the Pantry is blocked.

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:29.130
I see... There wasn't a sudden outbreak
of monsters here...

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:31.670
They just got backed up because
they couldn't get to their food.

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:33.630
Let's keep moving.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:38.380
Whatever is going on beyond this mass
is where our investigation begins.

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:41.790
Meryl.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:42.960
I-I'm on it!

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:50.630
I told you they would come, Revis.
Because you decided to neglect the monsters.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:53.380
More trouble. Just what we needed.

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:57.040
Aria!

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:59.710
What? Aria, you say?

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:03.460
I'll go.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:07.420
You just make sure you separate Aria from the group.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:11.880
Tch! Not a single damn clue!

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.500
Um...

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:19.380
Let's check that fatty's place next.

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:20.880
C-coming!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:28.830
A path...

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:33.630
Ugh, gross!

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:44.380
Keep moving.

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:50.210
I feel like we're in the belly of some beast...

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:53.380
Cut it out. You're giving me the chills.

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:58.290
Magic stones? What are those doing here?

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:03.880
My guess is that a few of those monsters
managed to stray inside.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:06.290
And something found them here.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.580
L-let's just hurry up the path.

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:11.380
It's coming!

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:18.670
Everyone, attack!

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:27.250
Battle formations!

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:28.580
Roger!

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:42.130
Sword Princess!

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:45.080
They're trying to divide us!

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.380
Sword Princess! No!

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:10.210
Focus on the fight at hand!

00:20:10.210 --> 00:20:11.170
But-!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:17.130
She's called the Sword Princess for a reason!
She can handle it!

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:19.330
Damn it!

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:25.250
I didn't think you'd come right to me.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:41.580
Oh, the Sword Princess sure did come through here.
Gave me this to hold on to.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:44.330
Miss Ais left this?

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:49.540
I don't care what she gave you.
Do you know where she was headed or not?

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:52.630
Hmm, I might know somethin' about it...

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:55.420
That is, for the right price!

00:20:57.830 --> 00:21:00.170
Spit it out, ya bastard.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:02.880
S-seems she went to the Pantry!

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:06.420
Level 24, the Pantry...

00:21:06.420 --> 00:21:11.130
I heard that she and her companions
bought up all the trap items in town.

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:13.380
She had other people with her?

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:15.330
Couldn't tell ya who.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:18.290
They were all wearin' hooded cloaks
to cover up their faces, see.

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:26.920
Damn Sword Princess, wolf bastard...
screw the whole damn Loki Familia!

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:28.330
Oy, Elf girl!

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:30.420
I'll pay you good money to go punch his stupid face in!

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:32.210
Not for a million valis.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.710
Looky here...

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.790
Did something happen with Miss Filvis?

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:41.630
You kiddin' me?

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:44.580
Wait, you didn't team up with the Banshee, didja?

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:48.040
"Banshee"?

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:52.580
Take my advice, stay away from her.

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:55.040
That Adventurer over there's cursed.

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:56.080
What?

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:02.710
No on who's teamed up with her...
has ever come back home alive.

00:22:06.710 --> 00:22:10.630
Good morning, open up the window and

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:14.080
You can go anywhere

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:17.960
A wish you whipser to yourself each day

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:21.960
To keep moving forward as far as you can

00:22:22.080 --> 00:22:28.710
You compare yourself to others, let out a sigh

00:22:28.710 --> 00:22:35.080
I know, I know

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:43.630
Kindness, warmth

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:47.330
One day the two of you

00:22:47.460 --> 00:22:54.040
Will surely know what it is to love

00:22:54.040 --> 00:23:01.130
The you of tomorrow will turn the you of today

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:04.710
Into memories and

00:23:04.710 --> 00:23:08.920
Move forwards past them

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:16.000
The rain will stop, you'll lift your chin up and

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:21.920
You'll be able to say "Thank you" with an honest smile

00:23:21.920 --> 00:23:25.380
Hello, hello, hello

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:34.170
Sing your love for someone

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:39.670
"The Corruption and the Maiden"
